Adding 5 to both sides: r - 5 + 5 = 8 + 5. Simplifying both sides, the left side becomes r because -5 and +5 cancel out. And 8 + 5 is 13. So, r equals 13. Let me check to make sure I did that right. If I plug r = 13 back into the original equation, it should hold true.

