Thus, (x -1)^2 = 2(y -1).

So this is the equation (x - h)^2 = 4p(y - k), which is a standard parabola opening upwards with vertex at (h, k). Here, 4p = 2, so p = 0.5. Therefore, this is a parabola with vertex at (1,1). So definitely a parabola. Hence, answer is P.

